<title>USA: Beaverton SD, Ore., $16.5 mln won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Beaverton SD, Ore., $16.5 mln won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $16.500 million of Beaverton School District No 48J, Ore., general obligation bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 4.63 percent.</p>
</text>
